{"version":1,"content":"<html><body><p>粉嶺靈山村昨日（29日）凌晨發生火警，一名72歲老翁被發現倒斃現場。有村民懷疑是電動單車的電池起火，惟當局仍未確定火警起因。死者3名親友今日（30日）到沙田富山殮房辦理認屍手續，表示對事件亦未清楚。</p><figure><img alt=\"兩女一男親友認屍後離開殮房。（黃學潤攝）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20260730/1159455489172443136052761.jpeg/iEX73I4kz8HnVvVY6QfYzrFHAAQ78gidnWGxTZ1hsU0\"/><figcaption>兩女一男親友認屍後離開殮房。（黃學潤攝）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"兩女一男親友認屍後離開殮房。（黃學潤攝）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20260730/1159455492066643968524860.jpeg/e-llhQuWPl9gwRjux_dZUSnkyOaS0AFDZHJJ9WRySfU\"/><figcaption>兩女一男親友認屍後離開殮房。（黃學潤攝）</figcaption></figure><p>今日（30日）上午11時左右，3名男女親友認屍後離開。他們坦言對火警情況了解不多，一切要待相關部門調查。</p><figure><img alt=\"消防員在場射水灌救。（讀者提供）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20260729/1159055510792572928609735.jpeg/nUrUKPAcZ3ABkIMga2ZnT-9eVRO9HF7PTn5CA05-QgM\"/><figcaption>消防員在場射水灌救。（讀者提供）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"消防員在場射水灌救。（讀者提供）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20260729/1159055513049239552684157.jpeg/DXBGblgAVX-vHqVzZBzupx947KB9VGYz9jSVxfY0lcU\"/><figcaption>消防員在場射水灌救。（讀者提供）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"有村民走火警。（讀者提供）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20260729/1159055515222020096750386.jpeg/CLSi5IT2mXsJC7Sk_f2ss1G-heRx92prn8BqhJ_AaoQ\"/><figcaption>有村民走火警。（讀者提供）</figcaption></figure><p>火警發生於昨日（29日）凌晨4時31分，靈山村一間鐵皮屋起火。消防員到場出動一條喉和一隊煙帽隊灌救，約49分鐘後將火救熄；其間36男42女，與及一批貓狗疏散到安全地方。至清晨6時26分，警方指，一名72歲姓葉男子被發現當場不治。</p><p>火警期間鐵皮屋一片通紅，消防員入村拖喉射水；村民在睡夢中驚醒紛紛走火警。事後有村民指起火單位有電動單車，見過有大量的電池在充電，懷疑火警與此有關。</p><p>警方稱，起火原因仍在調查中，現階段並無證據顯示案件涉及刑事成分。</p><figure><img alt=\"陳先生收拾細軟匆匆離開。（陳巧恩攝）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20260729/1159056717804212224748359.jpeg/oh2p2Q8GqMXGCFfwPftJdFf51ZxJ9YJemXdmcLN3ZnA\"/><figcaption>陳先生收拾細軟匆匆離開。（陳巧恩攝）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"彭太與丈夫和家姑逃出。（蔡正邦攝）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20260729/1159066459280773120293506.jpeg/o51-JactHY5QN5BUUgPDPMpKYCBuq9_2zaL73s2i-94\"/><figcaption>彭太與丈夫和家姑逃出。（蔡正邦攝）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"彭老太95歲，由兒子推輪椅走火警。（蔡正邦攝）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20260729/1159066462976086016685974.jpeg/-r0NMOEJ8OlmV_mlC_tQ6S0aSQnTkSfMOQpg9jkKYPY\"/><figcaption>彭老太95歲，由兒子推輪椅走火警。（蔡正邦攝）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"火警期間現場冒出熊熊烈火。（讀者提供）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20260729/1159060936519061504806539.jpeg/xAyoD7XupMMT4dzcBAJD5toIVIcSqlyxwnSu48J0ruM\"/><figcaption>火警期間現場冒出熊熊烈火。（讀者提供）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"火警期間現場冒出熊熊烈火。（讀者提供）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20260729/1159060940067573760732108.jpeg/8dPO267DCM0l3uvz_OqyhfOGxjjJAXxuu_jQrLv40Kw\"/><figcaption>火警期間現場冒出熊熊烈火。（讀者提供）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"火警期間現場冒出熊熊烈火。（讀者提供）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20260729/1159060943515422720026958.jpeg/bvlqGVVZlur6OXCIsyF1w6-ALFZqMfA14tBl7uLQZe4\"/><figcaption>火警期間現場冒出熊熊烈火。（讀者提供）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"火警熄滅後仍然冒出白煙。（陳巧恩攝）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20260729/1159057010294263808954801.jpeg/oiXkUJQKQaTAuULWyCW5k7wHy755dBCj6lEoVMBRKFQ\"/><figcaption>火警熄滅後仍然冒出白煙。（陳巧恩攝）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"消防員救出一隻貓。（陳巧恩攝）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20260729/1159049909794508800680315.jpeg/YjxAxXF-f5yhDzn6I1CnIC1OIJ0sgMn7PlDedz5Q3nc\"/><figcaption>消防員救出一隻貓。（陳巧恩攝）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"有寵物獲救。（陳巧恩攝）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20260729/1159049330259136512021587.jpeg/NzSHGoUQZLGhDqbGobaUENrmcnJh_qS3GPAtRxjwLUc\"/><figcaption>有寵物獲救。（陳巧恩攝）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"現場仍然冒出白煙。（陳巧恩攝）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20260729/1159048723960172544634287.jpeg/E_Q7zNlDJy_tePU-kE0qilCOmKaKRNHrPb9EMj2_RDI\"/><figcaption>現場仍然冒出白煙。（陳巧恩攝）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"現場仍然冒出白煙。（陳巧恩攝）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20260729/1159048726145536000518604.jpeg/-yHW5BRu9nnKFzOPTr0ZlJGRdwYb77TSczZ9EnM2fRI\"/><figcaption>現場仍然冒出白煙。（陳巧恩攝）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"居民疏散到路德會社區服務處休息。（彭紹殷攝）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20260729/1159063254442446848702569.jpeg/VWNt6f6BKoYoF0wxJnMpmt8B0auizQct1KqaOtSqmjo\"/><figcaption>居民疏散到路德會社區服務處休息。（彭紹殷攝）</figcaption></figure></body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-07-30T03:59:56.231094+00:00","quality":{"score":2,"chars":688,"images":17,"source":"HK01 突發","fallback":"none"}}